detaileddescription.para:
A pseudocode example of how can it look in theory:     struct tnt_exported_symbol {
            void *sym;
    };

    #define EXPORT_SYMBOL(symbol) \
            __attribute__((section(".tntexp")))
            struct tnt_exported_symbol tnt_exported_##sym = { \
                    .sym = (void *) symbol \
            };

